      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA beautiful one-off residential site extending to approximately 0.74 acres and offered for sale with the benefit of full planning permission for a four-bedroom bungalow extending to approximately 203.62 square metres together with a detached garage.\n\nThis attractive and level site enjoys a peaceful countryside setting at Knockboy, Clogher and offers the best of both worlds—rural living with the convenience of Castlebar just a short drive away. The property is ideally located within easy reach of schools and the vast array of amenities which Castlebar has to offer, presenting an excellent opportunity to create a superb family home."
      },
